  "deploymentDocs.k1": "Dawn Whales v${this.version} — Windows 安装指南",
  "deploymentDocs.k2": "1. 下载 Dawn-Whales-Setup-${this.version}.exe",
  "deploymentDocs.k3": "2. 双击 .exe 运行安装程序",
  "deploymentDocs.k4": "3. 如 SmartScreen 拦截，点击「更多信息」→「仍要运行」",
  "deploymentDocs.k5": "4. 选择安装目录（默认 C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Dawn Whales）",
  "deploymentDocs.k6": "5. 勾选「创建桌面快捷方式」",
  "deploymentDocs.k7": "6. 安装完成后启动，进入注册/登录页",
  "deploymentDocs.k8": "7. 首次启动自动激活 7 天免费试用",
  "deploymentDocs.k9": "8. 系统要求: Windows 10+ / x64 / 4GB RAM+",
  "deploymentDocs.k10": "Dawn Whales v${this.version} — macOS 安装指南",
  "deploymentDocs.k11": "1. 下载 Dawn-Whales-${this.version}.dmg",
  "deploymentDocs.k12": "2. 双击 .dmg 挂载镜像",
  "deploymentDocs.k13": "3. 将「Dawn Whales」拖入 Applications 文件夹",
  "deploymentDocs.k14": "4. 首次打开若提示「无法验证开发者」，前往 系统设置→隐私与安全性→仍要打开",
  "deploymentDocs.k15": "5. 双击 Applications 中的 Dawn Whales 启动",
  "deploymentDocs.k16": "6. 进入注册/登录页，首次启动自动激活 7 天免费试用",
  "deploymentDocs.k17": "7. 系统要求: macOS 12+ / Apple Silicon 或 Intel / 4GB RAM+",
  "deploymentDocs.k18": "Dawn Whales v${this.version} — Linux 安装指南",
  "deploymentDocs.k19": "1. 下载 Dawn-Whales-${this.version}.AppImage",
  "deploymentDocs.k20": "2. 打开终端，进入下载目录: cd ~/Downloads",
  "deploymentDocs.k21": "3. 赋予执行权限: chmod +x Dawn-Whales-${this.version}.AppImage",
  "deploymentDocs.k22": "4. 运行: ./Dawn-Whales-${this.version}.AppImage",
  "deploymentDocs.k23": "5. 如需桌面集成，安装 AppImageLauncher: sudo apt install appimagelauncher",
  "deploymentDocs.k24": "6. 进入注册/登录页，首次启动自动激活 7 天免费试用",
  "deploymentDocs.k25": "7. 系统要求: Ubuntu 22.04+ / x64 / 4GB RAM+",
  "deploymentDocs.k26": "前置要求",
  "deploymentDocs.k27": "服务器: Ubuntu 22.04+ / CentOS 8+，Node.js 20+，Nginx 1.24+，PM2 (npm i -g pm2)，域名已解析到服务器 IP，SSL 证书 (推荐 Let's Encrypt / certbot)",
  "deploymentDocs.k28": "部署步骤",
  "deploymentDocs.k29": "步骤 1: 获取代码",
  "deploymentDocs.k30": "步骤 2: 环境变量",
  "deploymentDocs.k31": "cp .env.example .env\\n# 编辑 .env:\\nDEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-key\\nJWT_SECRET=<随机128字符>\\nADMIN_API_TOKEN=<随机64字符>\\nPORT=3000\\nADMIN_PORT=3001\\nDOMAIN=dawnwhales.com",
  "deploymentDocs.k32": "步骤 3: 构建",
  "deploymentDocs.k33": "步骤 4: PM2 启动",
  "deploymentDocs.k34": "pm2 start ecosystem.config.json --env production\\npm2 save\\npm2 startup  # 开机自启",
  "deploymentDocs.k35": "步骤 5: Nginx 反向代理",
  "deploymentDocs.k36": "步骤 6: SSL 证书",
  "deploymentDocs.k37": "步骤 7: 验证",
  "deploymentDocs.k38": "curl https://api.dawnwhales.com/api/health\\n# 返回 {\"status\":\"ok\",\"version\":\"${v}\"}",
  "deploymentDocs.k39": "更新流程",
  "deploymentDocs.k40": "常见问题",
  "deploymentDocs.k41": "- PM2 进程未启动: pm2 logs dawn-whales-api 查看日志\\n- Nginx 502: 确认 Node 进程在监听 localhost:3000\\n- SSL 证书过期: certbot renew\\n- DeepSeek 调用失败: 检查 .env 中 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 是否有效",
  "deploymentDocs.k42": "监控建议",
  "deploymentDocs.k43": "- PM2: pm2 monit (CPU/内存实时)\\n- 日志: pm2 logs dawn-whales-api --lines 100\\n- 健康检查: GET /api/health (建议每 30s)\\n- 限流监控: PM2 日志中搜索 '429'\\n- 磁盘: 日志目录 logs/ 建议 logrotate 配置",
  "deploymentDocs.k44": "# Dawn Whales v${this.version} GA 部署文档",
  "deploymentDocs.k45": "## 桌面端安装",
  "deploymentDocs.k46": "## 服务器部署",
